          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2}{x+1}+\\frac{1}{x+2}&=\\frac{2(x+2)}{(x+1)(x+2)}+\\frac{x+1}{(x+1)(x+2)}\\\\&=\\frac{2x+4+x+1}{(x+1)(x+2)}\\\\&=\\frac{3x+5}{(x+1)(x+2)}\\end{align*}$$",
